    },
    "regime_notes": "Full-sample 20-day IC and ICIR pass the benchmark gates, with broad 15-instrument coverage and moderate turnover. Predictive sign deteriorated in 2026-2027 (2027 IC -0.044713, ICIR -0.145553 across 179 dates), while Q3 2027 was approximately neutral. Use capped and regime-aware rather than as an unrestricted standalone signal.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20271007_path_efficiency_signal.csv"
